cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you found our work useful, please cite the paper below."
title: "diabetes-xai-agreement"
abstract: >-
  Research pipeline for auditing population-level explainable AI agreement
  (SHAP vs permutation importance) in clinical risk prediction. Release
  jbi-v1 adds an audit protocol that separates agreement into
  contradiction, depth and head order, judges it against a seed-noise
  reference, and tests metric, model, attribution method, training
  configuration and outcome definition on BRFSS (2015, 2021, 2023) and
  NHANES (2017-March 2020, 2021-2023; diabetes and hypertension).
